alienMissions:
# - rescue convoy
# - defend cultists
# - defend beastmen
# - defend medicae shrine
# - Pathfinder ambush to match the Tanith?
# - Tau defense
# - Tau assault?
# - rescue loyalist Guard?
# - Destroy Arbites?

# Missions that contain Tau enemies are
# STR_ALIEN_ARTIFACT - x replaced with alternate
# STR_ALIEN_SABOTAGE - x does not get called by eliminated bases
# STR_RIOT - x does not get called by eliminated bases
# STR_ELDAR_ARTIFACT - x replaced with alternate
# STR_ALIEN_WAR - x replaced with alternate
# STR_ADEPTAS_WAR - x for adeptas only
# STR_DESERTER_HIDEOUT - x replaced with alternate
# STR_DESERTER_HIDEOUT_HARD - x replaced with alternate
# STR_RESCUE_PDF_VALKYRIE - x replaced with alternate
# STR_GUARD_OUTPOST_DEFENSE - x these only get called by Guard although they might be a good idea to replicate
# STR_ALIENER_ARTIFACT - x done this is the big vault
# STR_CATACH_TERROR_GO - do these even fire? - no they upstream require Imperial Guard Operations
# STR_CATACH_TERROR_GO2 - do these even fire? - no they upstream require Imperial Guard Operations
# STR_CATACH_TERROR_GO3 - do these even fire? - no they upstream require Imperial Guard Operations
# STR_CATACH_OUTPOST_DEFENSE - do these even fire? - no they upstream require Imperial Guard Operations
# STR_TAU_ORCAEXPEDITION - only fires in warpstorms which are replaced
# STR_TAU_ORCA_ASSAULT - does not appear to fire anywhere


